      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## CreatorPulse AI - Daily Content Notification\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow has three related automation paths for CreatorPulse AI notifications. A daily scheduled path reads upcoming creator events from Supabase, normalizes dates, determines the notification stage, uses Mistral-backed AI to draft email content, sends it through Gmail, and logs the notification. A second scheduled path handles important-day reminders, while a webhook path accepts incoming requests, generates structured AI output, stores it in Supabase, and returns a response.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure Supabase credentials and verify the referenced tables/columns for events, important days, and notification logs match the workflow queries and insert operations.\n- Configure Gmail OAuth credentials for the email sending nodes and confirm sender/recipient fields are mapped correctly.\n- Configure Mistral Cloud credentials for each AI Agent chat model node.\n- Set the two schedule triggers to the desired run frequency and timezone.\n- Activate the webhook URL and make sure incoming payload fields match what the AI and JavaScript formatting nodes expect.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust notification stage thresholds, email prompts, Gmail recipients, and Supabase table names or filters to match your content calendar and reminder policy."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
