      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are a professional content strategist, YouTube SEO expert, and social media growth specialist.\n\nGenerate content using this user information:\n\nPlatform:\n{{ $json.body.platform }}\n\nTopic:\n{{ $json.body.topic }}\n\nAudience:\n{{ $json.body.audience }}\n\nTone:\n{{ $json.body.tone }}\n\nContent Length:\n{{ $json.body.length }}\n\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\n{\n\"platform\":\"\",\n\"topic\":\"\",\n\"audience\":\"\",\n\"tone\":\"\",\n\"content_length\":\"\",\n\"title\":\"\",\n\"description\":\"\",\n\"hook\":\"\",\n\"script\":\"\",\n\"thumbnailIdea\":\"\",\n\"cta\":\"\",\n\"bestTime\":\"\",\n\"seoScore\":0,\n\"engagementScore\":0,\n\"viralityScore\":0,\n\"keywords\":[],\n\"hashtags\":[],\n\"ideas\":[]\n}\n\n\nRequirements:\n\n- Create content specifically for the given topic.\n- Create a viral title.\n- Write an engaging description.\n- Write a professional script.\n- Generate a strong opening hook.\n- Suggest thumbnail idea.\n- Generate CTA.\n- Give realistic SEO score.\n- Give engagement score.\n- Give virality score.\n- Generate 10 keywords.\n- Generate 15 hashtags.\n- Generate 5 related content ideas.\n\n\nReturn only JSON.\nDo not add markdown.\nDo not add explanations.",
